245	     * days of the day its log records it settled, by the sheet's today; its frozen figure then leaves every total
246	     * and the audit line ends with it as reversed. A claim due by inside a closed period cannot move. The sheet is locked
247	     * first, so moves on one sheet are made one at a time and no number is given twice.
